@page "/"

<div class="introduction col-6">
	<h1>Welcome to Terra Imperium web portal!</h1>
	<p>
		Terra Imperium is a turn-based strategy game developed in C# with the help of Unity.
		What makes it unique is that you can create your own artificial intelligence,
		which can compete with other AIs within the game. Then, you can also watch the match replays using Unity.
	</p>
	<p>
		To access the features of this website, please log in with your existing account.
	</p>
	<p>
		If you do not have an account yet, please register a new account and
		wait for an administrator to accept your registration request, then you will be able to log in.
	</p>
	<p>
		After logging in successfully, you can upload your AI files to participate in tournaments 
		and see the previous tournament results simulated by the organizers.
	</p>
</div>

